{"title":"Aug 9 — Fly Home","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 9 — Fly Home"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Sunday · August 9, 2026 · Day 15 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Last Morning & Fly Home ✈️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Birch Coffee · Salt Bread · Olive Young · Tamburins · 17:45 Depart Seoul</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug09\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug09').setView([37.5636, 126.9834], 14);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Shilla Stay Seodaemun Seoul Station', lat:37.5572, lng:126.9680, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul+Station' },\n    { name:'Birch Coffee ☕ (Brunch)', lat:37.5640, lng:126.9840, c:'#8B6914', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Birch+Coffee+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Olive Young 💄 (Last haul)', lat:37.5636, lng:126.9834, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Olive+Young+Myeongdong+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Tamburins 🧴', lat:37.5178, lng:127.0194, c:'#E53935', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tamburins+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Salt Bread 🍞 (Last one!)', lat:37.5810, lng:126.9700, c:'#FFA726', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=salt+bread+sogeumppang+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Seoul Station → Airport 🚄', lat:37.5547, lng:126.9706, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seoul+Station' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Breakfast — Shilla Stay Seodaemun</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T07:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9680\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00–10:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">INCLUDED ✓</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍳 Breakfast Buffet</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">CAFE B1F — Last Hotel Breakfast · Weekend Hours</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Final hotel breakfast before checkout. <strong>B1F · 07:00–10:30</strong> (Sunday). Breakfast included — no extra charge. Fuel up before the last morning in Seoul and the long flight home.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul+Station\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Shilla Stay</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Last Hours in Seoul</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T09:00\" data-lat=\"37.5640\" data-lng=\"126.9840\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">☕ Brunch</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Birch Coffee — Last Brunch</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">A lovely final Seoul coffee moment. Enjoy the last brunch before heading to the airport.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Birch+Coffee+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Birch Coffee</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T10:00\" data-lat=\"37.5810\" data-lng=\"126.9700\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">10:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍞 Snack</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Last Salt Bread (소금빵)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">One final crispy, buttery Korean salt bread before departure. Savour it.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=salt+bread+sogeumppang+Myeongdong+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Salt Bread</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Final Souvenir Run</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card shopping\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T10:30\" data-lat=\"37.5636\" data-lng=\"126.9834\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">10:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag shopping\">💄 Olive Young</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Final Olive Young Sweep</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Last chance for K-beauty — stock up on anything you ran out of or forgot from the first visit. Tax refund available with passport at the counter.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Olive+Young+Myeongdong+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Olive Young</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card shopping\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T11:00\" data-lat=\"37.5178\" data-lng=\"127.0194\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">11:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag shopping\">🧴 Tamburins</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Tamburins — Last Beauty Stop</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Artisan Korean beauty and perfume brand — beautiful packaging, unique scents. A luxury souvenir for yourself or as gifts.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tamburins+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Tamburins</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card shopping\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T11:30\" data-lat=\"37.5636\" data-lng=\"126.9834\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">11:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag shopping\">🍪 Snacks</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Korean Snacks & Gifts</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Last-minute snack shopping for the flight and for gifts back home. Great options:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Injeolmi (rice cake) — Korean traditional sweets</li>\n        <li>Choco Pies — classic Korean snack</li>\n        <li>Seaweed snack packs</li>\n        <li>Honey butter almonds</li>\n        <li>Korean ramen packs (check airlines allow)</li>\n        <li>Hallabong tangerine candies (from Jeju)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Korean+snacks+gifts+Myeongdong+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Snacks</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Airport</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T13:00\" data-lat=\"37.5547\" data-lng=\"126.9706\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">🚄 Airport Express</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Head to Incheon Airport</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Take the AREX from Seoul Station to Incheon Airport. Express train: ~43 min (₩9,500). Arrive at the airport by 14:30 at the latest for a 17:45 departure (give yourself 3+ hours for international check-in and security). <strong>Don't forget tax refund claims at the airport before check-in.</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seoul+Station+AREX\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Seoul Station</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-08-09T17:45\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">17:45</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">✈️ Departure</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Depart Seoul Incheon (ICN) → Vancouver (YVR)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">🇰🇷 Annyeong, Korea! 👋 What an incredible trip. ~10 hours to Vancouver. Due to the time zone difference, you'll arrive in Vancouver the same day — July 9.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Incheon+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 ICN Airport</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C62828,#8B0000);color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:28px 24px;margin-top:24px;text-align:center\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px\">🇰🇷 감사합니다</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px\">Korea Trip 2026 — Complete!</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity:0.85;font-size:14px\">15 days · 3 cities · Countless memories</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px\">Seoul · Jeju · Busan · 안녕히 가세요 👋</div>\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Sunday · August 9, 2026 · Da